    {
      "id": "rn_y3k4g9TctNyd49HS::L2::Q8",
      "moduleId": "rn_y3k4g9TctNyd49HS::L2",
      "stem": "Explain why classification depends only on the C-X carbon's neighbours.",
      "misconceptionClass": "definition logic",
      "kind": "explain-why",
      "modelAnswer": "The class names the substitution degree of the functional carbon, so only the alkyl groups bonded to that specific carbon count.",
